          "description": "Reference: the chem_opt = 170 emissions capture (MODE=default; GNU gfortran real32 in model; fork ctessum-claude/WRF branch earthsciml-instrumented-chem170, the `emissions` hook around emissions_driver in chem/chem_driver.F) at model step 1. Inputs are the replay's e_bio and the surface layer's depth; expected values are the real64 replay of add_biogenics (GUNTHER1 branch, compiled unchanged, kernels/emissions_driver), its increment over the step divided by dt, at 1e-9 relative. The zero tendencies of ISO, OLI, XYL and ETH are FORTRAN_BUGS.md B25.",
